Upon making a critical melee attack the savagery of your predation causes a Cursed Miasma to begin permeating your hunting grounds.

The miasma will seep from [3, 4, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] locations, including your own, within radius 4, deals [35, 47, 56, 64, 71 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage split between Darkness and Mind and blocks sight.

Prey lost within your miasma have a [5%, 8%, 10%, 13%, 15% (TL1-5)] chance to lose track of you and may mistake friends for foe.

Savage Hunter costs 8 Hate on trigger and does not trigger when you're in Cursed Miasma.
